## English Summary

**`tianracer-ros-humble` is the ROS 2 Humble version of the upstream project
[`tianracer`](https://github.com/tianbot/tianracer) by Tianbot.** It is a derivative work based on
the upstream `humble-devel` branch. The upstream project targets ROS 1; this project is its
ROS 2 Humble port (colcon/ament, Python 3, Gazebo Sim 7 Fortress, Nav2, an `rclpy` race judge),
with the real-hardware packages removed.

This project is distributed under the **GNU General Public License v3.0** (see `LICENSE`), because
the upstream repository is released under GPL-3.0 and a derivative work must be distributed under
the same license. Previously-existing upstream license notices are preserved — in particular, the
upstream `tianracer_navigation2` package was declared under the MIT license, whose notice is
retained above. Copyright of upstream code remains with its original authors.
